  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened institutional capacity of employers&apos; organizations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ILO will provide technical assistance to the Union of Employers of the Republic of Tajikistan (ORRT) to enhance member engagement and organizational effectiveness. This includes amplifying digital outreach to improve visibility services as well as strengthening membership governance framework to accommodate faster membership growth and better value for members. The ILO will support the ORRT in developing a comprehensive membership strategy and implementing a targeted campaign to broaden membership base and enhance member retention.</narrative>
  </description>
